  "caption": "Mandarin dancehall, early-2000s digital riddim style. Snappy rimshot snare and kick pattern, deep round sub bass, plucky steel-tongue synth melody, offbeat skank keyboard chords. Punchy sound-system low end, dry and loud, bouncy groove. Male baritone, toasting-style rhythmic chant in the verses and a sing-along chorus. 100 BPM, A minor. Playful, boastful and bouncy. No trap hi-hats, no autotune, no reggaeton dembow, no EDM build, no rock guitars.",
  "lyrics": "[Intro - rimshot riddim, sub bass, steel-tongue plucks]\n\n[Verse 1]\n一年沒用牙線\n下禮拜要洗牙\n我買了一大盒\n早上晚上都在拉\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n刷完再拉 拉完再刷\n鏡子前面練笑容\n\n[Chorus]\n這是我的牙線週\n七天變成好學生\n這是我的牙線週\n醫生你看我多認真\n\n[Verse 2]\n躺在椅子上張開嘴\n燈一照 她不說話\n小鏡子勾一勾\n牙齦有一點紅\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n她說這禮拜才開始吧\n我說妳怎麼知道\n\n[Chorus]\n這是我的牙線週\n七天騙不過一個人\n這是我的牙線週\n下次我從今天開始\n\n[Outro - riddim drops to sub bass and plucks, fades]",
